{"title": "Mumbai Crime Branch Probes IIT Bombay Student's Death", "summary": "The Mumbai Crime Branch has taken over the investigation into the death of an IIT Bombay student. Sources indicate the student, identified as Sahil, spoke to a friend hours before his death, admitting he had \"made a mistake.\" A 10-member committee at IIT Bombay has also commenced its own probe. Meanwhile, the student's parents have denied claims that he was receiving counseling. The case has seen the spread of AI-generated images purported to be of IIT-B students amidst the ongoing investigation.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "मुंबई क्राइम ब्रांच IIT बॉम्बे छात्र की मौत की जांच कर रही है", "summary_hi": "मुंबई क्राइम ब्रांच ने IIT बॉम्बे के एक छात्र की मौत की जांच अपने हाथ में ले ली है। सूत्रों के अनुसार, छात्र, जिसकी पहचान साहिल के रूप में हुई है, ने अपनी मौत से कुछ घंटे पहले एक दोस्त से बात की थी और स्वीकार किया था कि उसने \"गलती\" की है। IIT बॉम्बे की 10 सदस्यीय समिति ने भी अपनी जांच शुरू कर दी है। इस बीच, छात्र के माता-पिता ने इस दावे का खंडन किया है कि वह परामर्श ले रहा था। चल रही जांच के बीच छात्र की AI-जनित तस्वीरें IIT-B के छात्रों के रूप में फैलाई गई हैं।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["Leads with the Mumbai Crime Branch taking over the probe into the student's death."], "center": ["Highlights that the student spoke to a friend hours before his death, admitting he \"made a mistake.\"", "Mentions the parallel probe by a 10-member IIT Bombay committee.", "Reports on the spread of AI-generated images falsely presented as those of IIT-B students."], "right": ["Emphasizes the transfer of the case to the Crime Branch while urging against speculation and misinformation.", "Focuses on the parents' denial of claims that the student was receiving counseling."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["छात्र की मौत की जांच क्राइम ब्रांच को सौंपे जाने की खबर को प्रमुखता से दिखाता है।"], "center": ["इस बात पर प्रकाश डालता है कि छात्र ने अपनी मौत से कुछ घंटे पहले एक दोस्त से बात की थी और स्वीकार किया था कि उसने \"गलती\" की है।", "IIT बॉम्बे की 10 सदस्यीय समिति द्वारा समानांतर जांच का उल्लेख करता है।", "IIT-B के छात्रों की AI-जनित तस्वीरों के झूठे प्रसार की रिपोर्ट करता है।"], "right": ["सट्टा और दुष्प्रचार के खिलाफ आग्रह करते हुए मामले को क्राइम ब्रांच को हस्तांतरित करने पर जोर देता है।", "छात्र के परामर्श लेने के दावों के माता-पिता द्वारा खंडन पर केंद्रित है।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/3l1ur9/article71499709.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/20260922158L.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/mumbai/iit-bombay-student-death-acp-rank-officer-tasked-with-crime-branch-probe/article71499357.ece", "headline": "IIT-Bombay student death: ACP-rank officer tasked with Crime Branch probe"}, {"source": "The Quint", "owner": "The Quint", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "AI-Generated Images Shared as Those of IIT-B Students Amid Suicide Case Probe"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/hours-before-death-iit-bombay-student-sahil-wokade-told-friend-he-made-a-mistake-sources-12086982", "headline": "Hours Before Death, IIT Bombay Student Told Friend He \"Made A Mistake\": Sources"}, {"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Mumbai Police Transfer IIT Bombay Student’s Death Case to Crime Branch; Urge Against Speculation & Spreading Misinformation"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "VBA leader Ambedkar leads ‘Justice for Sahil’ protest at IIT Bombay"}, {"source": "Hindustan Times", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "